# 统一换行，避免 Windows 上开发、Linux 上构建出现 CRLF 问题
# （Dockerfile 的续行符对 CRLF 很敏感，必须强制 LF）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.db binary

Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
